{
  "slug": "track-stock-item-name-matches",
  "title": "Checking Similar Stock Item Names Before Using a Report",
  "description": "Trace a stock result to the correct TallyPrime item when variants share the same brand or description.",
  "category": "Stock and balances",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "List the distinguishing details",
      "body": "In an illustrative catalogue, Canvas Shoe 7 and Canvas Shoe 8 are separate items. Note the full name and unit from TallyPrime. Compare the company as well, since two firms in the same dashboard may carry similarly named stock."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Confirm the item on the synced view",
      "body": "Search for the complete item name and open its details. Compare the visible identifiers with the source. If you cannot tell which variant the report shows, check one known purchase or sale in the accounting records before using the result."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Keep the exact reference for follow-up",
      "body": "Share the complete item name and unit with the person investigating. Include the date or location filters if you used any. A name-only screenshot can hide the context that distinguishes two records."
    }
  ],
